{
    "title": "Jerry: The AllCar\u2122 App",
    "description": "Jerry is America\u2019s first AllCar\u2122 app. Compare car insurance policies, loans, and repair costs, and get incredible rewards just for driving. \r\n\r\nJerry makes it easy to manage everything to do with your car\u2014and changes car ownership for the better. Because we car. From now on, count on Jerry to help you:\r\n\r\n\r\nGET A GREAT INSURANCE RATE WITH PRICEPROTECT\u2122\r\n\r\n\u2022 Compare and buy insurance from up to 50 insurers in less than 2 minutes\r\n\u2022 Bundle your home or renters policies for even more savings\r\n\u2022 Be sure you\u2019re never overpaying with automatic rate checks \r\n\u2022 Connect with our agents in the app or by phone \r\n\u2022 No spam, long forms, unwanted phone calls or pushy sales people\r\n\r\n\r\nFIND A BETTER AUTO LOAN WITH PRICEPROTECT\u2122\r\n\r\nCompare lenders for your car loan with our easy refinancing\u2014and say goodbye to high monthly payments. Get pre-qualified right in the app.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get offers from top lenders that lower your monthly payment and/or interest rate with no impact to your credit score\r\n\u2022 See your offers in just minutes and easily refinance your loan in the app\r\n\r\n\r\nSEE YOUR DRIVING SCORE AND EARN REWARDS FOR GOOD DRIVING WITH DRIVESHIELD\u2122\r\n\r\nEarn rewards with every mile\u2014just for being a safe driver. With Jerry, driving is always rewarding.\r\n\r\nKnow exactly how you\u2019re doing on the road with our driving score tracker. Opt in to get a score after each trip\u2014plus immediate feedback on ways to improve the safety of your driving and reduce the risk of accidents. Help keep you and your family safe on the roads by following these tips to improve your driving habits.\r\n\r\n\r\nCHECK MAINTENANCE & REPAIR COSTS WITH GARAGEGUARD\u2122\r\n\r\nNever worry if you\u2019re overpaying for car repairs or maintenance again. Get clarity on what the right price is, right now. We\u2019ll also let you know about recalls and remind you about scheduled maintenance.\r\n\r\n\r\nGET PEACE OF MIND WITH OUR DATALOCK\u2122 GUARANTEE\r\n\r\nJerry protects your data. Our DataLock\u2122 Guarantee ensures when you shop for insurance with Jerry, you won't be contacted by anyone but us.\r\n\r\n\r\nTRUSTED BY 4 MILLION CUSTOMERS\r\n\r\n4 million customers have discovered the better way to do car ownership. So join them. \r\n\r\nJerry is a licensed insurance broker in 50 U.S. states and Washington, D.C.\r\n\r\nhttps://getjerry.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jerry is America\u2019s first AllCar\u2122 app. Compare car insurance policies, loans, and repair costs, and get incredible rewards just for driving. <br><br>Jerry makes it easy to manage everything to do with your car\u2014and changes car ownership for the better. Because we car. From now on, count on Jerry to help you:<br><br><br>GET A GREAT INSURANCE RATE WITH PRICEPROTECT\u2122<br><br>\u2022 Compare and buy insurance from up to 50 insurers in less than 2 minutes<br>\u2022 Bundle your home or renters policies for even more savings<br>\u2022 Be sure you\u2019re never overpaying with automatic rate checks <br>\u2022 Connect with our agents in the app or by phone <br>\u2022 No spam, long forms, unwanted phone calls or pushy sales people<br><br><br>FIND A BETTER AUTO LOAN WITH PRICEPROTECT\u2122<br><br>Compare lenders for your car loan with our easy refinancing\u2014and say goodbye to high monthly payments. Get pre-qualified right in the app.<br><br>\u2022 Get offers from top lenders that lower your monthly payment and/or interest rate with no impact to your credit score<br>\u2022 See your offers in just minutes and easily refinance your loan in the app<br><br><br>SEE YOUR DRIVING SCORE AND EARN REWARDS FOR GOOD DRIVING WITH DRIVESHIELD\u2122<br><br>Earn rewards with every mile\u2014just for being a safe driver. With Jerry, driving is always rewarding.<br><br>Know exactly how you\u2019re doing on the road with our driving score tracker. Opt in to get a score after each trip\u2014plus immediate feedback on ways to improve the safety of your driving and reduce the risk of accidents. Help keep you and your family safe on the roads by following these tips to improve your driving habits.<br><br><br>CHECK MAINTENANCE &amp; REPAIR COSTS WITH GARAGEGUARD\u2122<br><br>Never worry if you\u2019re overpaying for car repairs or maintenance again. Get clarity on what the right price is, right now. We\u2019ll also let you know about recalls and remind you about scheduled maintenance.<br><br><br>GET PEACE OF MIND WITH OUR DATALOCK\u2122 GUARANTEE<br><br>Jerry protects your data. Our DataLock\u2122 Guarantee ensures when you shop for insurance with Jerry, you won&#39;t be contacted by anyone but us.<br><br><br>TRUSTED BY 4 MILLION CUSTOMERS<br><br>4 million customers have discovered the better way to do car ownership. So join them. <br><br>Jerry is a licensed insurance broker in 50 U.S. states and Washington, D.C.<br><br>https://getjerry.com/",
